                                                "sense_id": "7d40b702-50fa-31a4-bc12-10505053861c",
                                                "text": "I'm in advertising, you know. Oh, yes. I designed the ad campaign that put those pictures of missing children on bags of kitty litter. Every time you change the cat box, there are those little faces looking up at you. It has to help. Think about it."
                                            }
